Our One-Minute Pitch — PairPressure
Have you ever wanted to study with someone but struggled to find a partner who takes the same courses or is available at the same time?
That's the problem we're trying to solve with PairPressure.
PairPressure is a platform designed to help university students find compatible study partners based on their courses, schedules, and study preferences.
Instead of relying on random group chats or awkwardly approaching classmates, students can create profiles, browse potential partners, and use a simple swipe-based matching system to find people who fit their study needs.
Our goal is to make studying more convenient, encourage collaboration, and help students build meaningful academic connections.
With PairPressure, finding the right study partner doesn't have to be stressful.
